@module enemies
$A91B c AbsDiffAtMost ; Carry when |E - D| is at most A
> In: A the limit, D and E the two values. Out: A = |E - D|, carry set when it is under the limit or equal to it. The limit goes into its own compare at AbsDiffLimit $A924. Stage 1's AbsDiffBelow $A7B8 had no equal case: stage 2 adds RET NZ / CCF (carry on equal).
> Used for the hero's distances: DamageIfTouching $8760 (the touches), InStrikeReach $AA06, DropActorTouch $A999, the fragments ($AB3F), $9B61 and $9B77.
> Witness: L1 598 (rzx-r2, s2-right, stageload).
