$A929 c DropActor ; Kind 6: a drop that falls from the ceiling, splashes and comes again
> The handler of ActorKinds kind 6 ($963E), placed in grid 1 at line 2 of six columns. Colour red or magenta (ColourRedMagenta $B499). The frame +8 (DropSet, from $ED59 over $ECE6) is the state: 0-5 the drop forming (a step a pass, DropActorWait), 6 the fall: 4 lines a pass ($8F84) until the cell under it (column + 3, line + $0C: CellAt $B2DC) is solid, then 7-$0B the splash (effect $0A, PlaySoundVector, at frame $0A), $0C the end: the line back to $10 (+$0E), a random wait $0A-$29 (+$0A) at frame $0D, then 0 again. In the fall it costs the hero 4 energy when he stands in its column and within $0C lines (DropActorTouch $A999).
> In s2-right 1086 passes (the blue rooms of grid 1 before the game over), in rzx-r2 2255 (the red drops in the screens of grid 1).
> Witness: L1 3341 (rzx-r2, s2-right).
