> Seeds RandomPointer $FE0A with $07CF (so every burst looks the same), writes B and C into the LD D / LD E at FragmentColumn $AA4E and FragmentLine $AA50, and for each of the D fragments takes a free actor record (FindFreeActor $8D71; it stops quietly when none is free), random parameters (RandomFragmentParams $AA5E) and starts it (InitFragment $AA6C). IY is kept.
